    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86-a4">

                <pb facs="1113" n="955" xml:id="pg955"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">notice to exporters and shippers of meat
                        products</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps">fresh, canned, salted, or
                        pickled, and otherwise cured</hi>) <hi rendition="#small-caps">from the
                        united states of america to ports of italy</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Italian Chamber of Commerce</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">35
                                Broadway, New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Italian Government has notified all customs districts of the Kingdom to
                    refuse admittance to any shipment of meat products coming from United States
                    ports, unless it be accompanied by a certificate of soundness.</p>
                <p>According to this new rule the Italian consulate-general in New York has
                    appointed official examiners Messrs. Thomas Goulard &amp; Co., licensed
                    inspectors, 36 and 38 Whitehall street, New York, who will deliver to parties
                    interested in sworn certificates, to be legalized by the Italian
                    consulate-general in New York, in order to fulfill the requirements of the
                    Italian Government.</p>
                <p>For any further information apply to the</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Italian Chamber of Commerce</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">235 Broadway, New York.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
